  "crew": [
    {
      "name": "Antonino Balistreri",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::a88b6380-66d1-11ef-b9a3-976a7fce3c94::assets::c38944e0-899d-11f1-be51-af40d3b1a658/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Nationality: Italian\nLanguages: Italian, English\n\nCaptain Antonino Balistreri is a dedicated and highly motivated maritime professional with a lifelong passion for the sea. Born into a family of seafarers, he developed a strong connection with the marine world from an early age and has worked with determination to turn this passion into his career.\n\nAt 34 years old, Antonino combines solid seafaring experience with a calm, focused, and disciplined approach to command. He is a determined leader who values teamwork and believes in creating a strong, well-coordinated crew environment on board.\n\nHis years at sea have taught him the importance of remaining composed under pressure, maintaining control in challenging situations, and coordinating every detail with precision. Whether navigating, managing operations, or supervising the crew, Antonino brings confidence, responsibility, and attention to detail to every aspect of his role.\nCommitted to continuous professional and personal growth, he constantly works to refine his skills and strengthen his leadership abilities. His professionalism, passion for the sea, and ability to lead with clarity make him a reliable and valuable Captain, dedicated to ensuring a safe, smooth, and memorable experience for guests on board."
    },
    {
      "name": "Maria Chiara Brazzò",
      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::a88b6380-66d1-11ef-b9a3-976a7fce3c94::assets::0c59b600-899e-11f1-bb08-7d3bdad2f4ec/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Nationality: Italian\nLanguages: Italian, English, Spanish\n\nMaria Chiara is a professional and highly motivated Stewardess with solid experience on board both private and charter yachts, including vessels such as Antago 82, Sanlorenzo 120, Azimut 116 and Pershing 7X.\nOriginally from Palermo, she brings a strong maritime background and a genuine passion for hospitality at sea. Her experience has allowed her to develop excellent skills in five-star service, high-level housekeeping, guest care and\nonboard organisation, always with discretion, precision and attention to detail.\nDynamic, reliable and flexible, Maria Chiara is used to the demanding rhythm of charter life and is able to maintain high standards even during intense working schedules. She is particularly appreciated for her positive energy, proactive attitude and ability to anticipate guests’ needs before they are expressed.\nHer background also includes nautical training as an Officer Cadet, a boating licence within 12 nautical miles, STCW Basic Training, GMDSS Short Range Certificate, RoRo Pax certification, first aid and additional courses in meteorology,\nsailing navigation and defibrillator use.\nFluent in Italian and with knowledge of English and Spanish, Maria Chiara is able to interact naturally with international guests and crew. Her communication skills, sense of organisation and passion for creating memorable onboard experiences make her a valuable asset to any luxury yacht crew."
    }
  ],
